  "safetyBody": "Keep all conversations in Vitto. Never share your confirmation code before you have checked the item. Meet in busy public places. Never pay outside Vitto for an online Deal.",
  "prohibitedTitle": "Prohibited items",
  "prohibitedBody": "Weapons, drugs, stolen goods, counterfeit products, animals, and anything illegal in Nigeria or Benin are not allowed.",
  "supportTitle": "Need help?",
  "supportBody": "Use \"Report\" on a Listing, profile or Deal. Our team reviews reports and disputes, usually within 72 hours.",
  "legalDraftNotice": "Draft – to be replaced after legal review for Nigeria and Benin before launch.",
  "termsBody": "Vitto is a marketplace that connects buyers and sellers of physical products in Nigeria and Benin. Users are responsible for the accuracy of their Listings and for the items they sell. Online payments are processed by licensed payment providers; Vitto releases seller payouts only after the buyer confirms receipt or an admin decides a dispute. Offline exchanges happen directly between users and Vitto does not handle that money. Prohibited items are not allowed. Vitto may suspend Listings or accounts that break these rules.",
  "privacyBody": "We collect only what is needed to run the marketplace: your account details, profile, Listings, messages, offers, deals and reports. Card details are never stored by Vitto; payments are handled by the payment provider. Messages are visible only to the two participants, and to admins when reviewing a report or dispute. You can ask us to delete your account; some records (deals, payments, disputes) are kept as required by law."
